WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.508
Right now, we've been
seeing a huge increase

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.244
from people ordering
stuff off of the dark web.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.846
CUSTOMS OFFICER
1: The dark web is

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.515
a criminal flea market anyone
with the internet can access.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.518
There was a big website
back in the day, Silk Road.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:19.986
My understanding is
that was taken down,

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.354
but there are other
versions of it.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.989
CUSTOMS OFFICER 1: You can
purchase drugs, weapons,

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:26.092
stolen credit card numbers,
and virtually anything illegal

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:29.362
on this marketplace.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:32.499
[urgent music playing]

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.971
They can go on the website,
they can create fake IP

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.774
addresses, the demand is here.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:47.480
Anything that you
buy on the dark web

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:51.384
has a potential to be the
most dangerous drug out there.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.086
You might think that
you're buying ecstasy,

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:54.788
and it could be fentanyl.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:55.855
You don't know what it is.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.630
[urgent music playing]

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.608
CHIP: Sprinkles for ice cream.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.885
CHIP (VOICEOVER): We noticed
some anomalies on the X-ray.

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.554
Could be coffee, could be pills.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.295
Pills from Spain.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.430
Two packages from
the same sender.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:44.304
Approximately the same
quantity in each one.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.772
I'm going to have
to take it inside

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.273
and use a field test kit.

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:55.515
This is a test kit
for MDMA and ecstasy.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:59.652
Positive results should be
very dark blue to black.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:07.760
Dark blue, positive test.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:11.097
Take it over and weigh it.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:15.235
[urgent music playing]

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.108
CHIP: We've called
HSI, and the agents

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:24.043
will be here shortly
to pick these up for

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.913
a possible controlled delivery.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.482
We've seen a number of these
going to numerous locations

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.484
throughout the United States.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:34.621
Some of them going to New York,
some of them going to Vegas.

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:41.094
[buzzing]

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.129
HSI OFFICER: Hey Chip,
how are you doing?

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.797
CHIP: Got two,
going to New York.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:47.600
HSI OFFICER: Appreciate
your help, thank you.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.835
CHIP: Anytime.

